            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kigira kunyi koveeye avana va Nyasaye, sivoveeye vulahi kuganagana ndi Nyasaye aveeye kuli izahabu, ifeza, anoho kali kuli ligina liavazwa; vindu viakongwa nu vusiza kandi no vogeri vwa avandu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyasaye yayivilira zing'inga ziavandu vavura, kumumanya, Navuzwa kalunu, alaangaa avandu vosi, havundu hoosi, viganiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kigira umali kotovola lidiku lia alikalagira kivala nu vulungi, kuvitira ku mundu mulala wa yatovola. Yahaana ku avandu vosi lisuuviriza lwa lisimugukiza kutura mu vakuzu!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Navuzwa lwa vahulira Paolo navoora makuva gi lisimuguka lia avakuzu, avalala kuvo eseko yaali ivamale; navuzwa avandi vavoola, “Kulayaanza kukuhulira kandi ku likuva yili!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunangwa Paolo yavaleka, natura hagati hi livugana liavo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Navuzwa avandu valala vahambana naye nivasuuvira. Mulala kuvo yaali Dionisio mulala ku avikiyaalo cha Areopaga, kandi yaali ho mukali mulala walangwa Damari, na avandi avasuuviraa harara navo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paolo yilwaza mu Korinzo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
